<tr id="A3.T3.3.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.3.1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Presence of the correct diagnosis in the first position of</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.3.1.2.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.3.1.2.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">the differential diagnosis list given in the post-questionnaire.</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.3.1.2.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
