<tr id="A3.T3.3.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.3.1.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Similar to top-1 accuracy but checks the presence of the</td></tr>
